===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[cross]] shaped like a T with a loop at the top, the Egyptian [[hieroglyph]] representing the Egyptian triliteral {{term||ˁ-n-ḫ|eternal life}} and often used as an [[amulet]] or charm for this concept.
: <hiero>anx</hiero>
# {{Wicca}} A protection.
